<span class="badge badge-info">Ticket Assigned</span>
<h1>New Ticket Assignment Alert</h1>
<p>Hello {{recipientName}},</p>
<p>The following support ticket has been assigned to you for resolution. Please review the ticket details, investigate the issue, and update the status accordingly.</p>

<div class="meta-box">
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">Ticket ID:</td>
      <td class="meta-value"><strong>{{ticketNumber}}</strong></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">Subject:</td>
      <td class="meta-value">{{title}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">Priority:</td>
      <td class="meta-value">{{priority}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="meta-label">Description:</td>
      <td class="meta-value">{{description}}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<p>You can access the ticket details and begin working on it by clicking the button below:</p>

{{button "Review & Work Ticket" actionUrl}}

<p style="margin-top: 24px;">Regards,<br/>CampusCare Queue Dispatcher</p>
